            e = rv.exp // 2
        else:
            p = perfect_power(rv.exp)
            if not p:
                return rv
            e = rv.exp // 2
        return h(g(rv.base.args[0])**2)**e
```

This modification ensures that the comparison is only performed when the exponent is a real number, thus avoiding the `TypeError`.

